BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Uncertain Detective Season 4
DTSTART:20250930T021000Z
DTEND:20250930T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20250930T021000Z
UID:WRqADAcmFa
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nPresented by Uncertain Producti
 ons. Sneak preview of the new season of this Seattle-produced YouTube favo
 rite. A film director creates a surreal\, neo-noir tv series featuring a b
 umbling detective\, casts his wife and kids in it\, and tries to juggle hi
 s two worlds. Q&A with creator Gregg Lachow. $13 ($10 Students & Seniors)\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-uncertain-detective-season-
 4
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Little Forest (2018)
DTSTART:20251004T020000Z
DTEND:20251004T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20251004T020000Z
UID:SYQ1fEAO2f
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nYim Soon-rye’s gentlest film t
 ransplants Little Forest\, Daisuke Igarashi’s manga about slow living an
 d natural cooking\, to the Korean countryside. Introduction and Q&A with D
 irector Yim Soon-rye moderated by Ungsan Kim\, University of Washington Ce
 nter for Korea Studies.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/little-
 forest
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
