UID:nQ53x3l8qV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nScarecrowber A proper kick-off\, 
 Dr. (of music and theology) Phibes mimics the G'tach—the ten lethal plag
 ues of Egypt—with intentions of vengeance against the doctors and nurses
  responsible for a botched operation that resulted in the death of his wif
 e.  Introduced by Scarecrow Video's Jonathan Marlow.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/programs-and-events/scarecrowber-2025/the-abominable-dr-phibes
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
